{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39693","headline":"出京别崔学士 · 黄滔","name":"出京别崔学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从门馆遍投文，旋忝恩知骤出羣。\n不道鹤鸡殊羽翼，许依龙虎借风云。\n命奇未便乘东律，言重终期雪北军。\n欲逐飘蓬向岐路，数宵垂泪恋清芬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}